title Template Method Pattern in JHotDraw (Focused)

abstract class AbstractFigure {
    .. Template Methods ..
    + displayBox(Rectangle r)
    + moveBy(int dx, int dy)
    .. Primitive Operations (Hooks) ..
    # {abstract} basicDisplayBox(Point p1, Point p2)
    # {abstract} basicMoveBy(int dx, int dy)
}

note right of AbstractFigure::displayBox
  **Template Method:**
  void displayBox(Rectangle r) {
    willChange();
    basicDisplayBox(r.origin, r.corner);
    changed();
  }
end note

class RectangleFigure {
